Yes it's a FAQ, but since this group seems so secretive about binaries 
locations (WHERE'S THAT FAQ SHEET???) then it's perfectly OK to ask.

>Basically: where can I get binaries of the latest version of NetHack,
>suitable for running on a 286 pc?
>
Binaries for the 286 pc can be found at wuarchive.wustl.edu in the directory
/pub/MSDOS_UPLOADS/games.  The file nh312pc.exe is the zipfile for the 286
pc.  For 386 & above, the zipfile is nh312386.exe in the same directory.
